{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id1563742927"}, "name":{"label":"Alex would like to know"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-14T01:56:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12418522531"}, "title":{"label":"Paywall on basic features"}, "content":{"label":"The fact you can only lock up to 2 apps without a paid subscription makes me give this app 1 star.\n Being unable to block websites is annoying too.\nHaving to pay for skips is ridiculous since if you really want to use your phone at a certain time you can just uninstall the app and the fact they let you choose the price of skips is just to give the user the illusion of free will, if we really have to pick the price for something let us pick the price of the subscriptions that lock us out of most features.\n\nThis app has a very good concept but terrible execution.\nInstead of paying for a subscription to access VERY BASIC FEATURES there should be ads so users can enjoy a free experience \nOr introduce a token system where you can pay for tokens or watch ads to obtain them, these tokens can be used for things such as increasing capacity of banned apps.\nThe only thing a user should be paying for is for cosmetic upgrades and non essential features", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-04T03:34:29-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
